[coughing]

1504
01:38:00,025 --> 01:38:02,025
[panting]

1505
01:38:20,665 --> 01:38:23,425
[electronic dance music playing]

1506
01:38:31,025 --> 01:38:32,305
[music stops]

1507
01:38:45,145 --> 01:38:46,545
- Hey.
- Hm.

1508
01:38:46,625 --> 01:38:48,425
You're Martín's daughter, right?

1509
01:38:50,985 --> 01:38:52,265
From the pharma company.

1510
01:38:54,545 --> 01:38:56,625
Tell me something. He's not dead, is he?

1511
01:38:57,785 --> 01:38:58,665
What?

1512
01:38:59,385 --> 01:39:02,105
It's a cover-up
so he can keep investigating, isn't it?

1513
01:39:02,185 --> 01:39:03,745
So they'll leave him alone.

1514
01:39:04,745 --> 01:39:06,065
Gotta keep it secret, huh?

1515
01:39:06,145 --> 01:39:09,065
Because the police,
the media, they're all in on it.

1516
01:39:09,905 --> 01:39:13,785
It's obvious that they experimented
on the boy and threw the body in the lake.

1517
01:39:14,865 --> 01:39:16,065
What are you saying?

1518
01:39:17,265 --> 01:39:19,225
Don't you realize all of that's nonsense?

1519
01:39:21,825 --> 01:39:22,905
[snickers]

1520
01:39:23,625 --> 01:39:25,225
Right. [laughs]

1521
01:39:25,305 --> 01:39:28,385
You have to keep quiet?
Does that put you in danger?

1522
01:39:29,465 --> 01:39:32,625
I get it. But one day
the truth will come out.

1523
01:39:33,105 --> 01:39:35,705
I think your father's gonna
bring everything to light.

1524
01:39:35,785 --> 01:39:38,585
He's an inspiration for so, so many of us.

1525
01:39:39,465 --> 01:39:40,705
Tell him I said that.

1526
01:39:43,465 --> 01:39:44,545
So cool.

1527
01:39:47,025 --> 01:39:49,585
[intriguing music playing]

1528
01:40:18,025 --> 01:40:21,985
NO MORE LIES

1529
01:40:22,065 --> 01:40:24,305
WHO IS BEHIND EVERYTHING?

1530
01:40:24,385 --> 01:40:26,945
WAKE UP

1531
